==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|въскрѣсити}}. {{surf|ru|вос-|крес|-ить}}. More at {{m|sla-pro|*kresati}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|воскреси́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Cinemantique-воскресить.wav}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|воскреси́ть|pf|impf=воскреша́ть}}

# to [[raise]] from the [[dead]], to [[resurrect]]
# to [[revive]], to [[resuscitate]], to [[reanimate]]
# to [[revive]], to [[recall]], to [[call up]], to [[bring back]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''воскреси́ть''' [[в]] [[память|па́мяти]]|to conjure up (bring back) the memory (of)}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4b+p|воскреси́ть}}

